Self-signed test certificate for M0-T09. CN=field.test.invalid, valid to 2036.
Not trusted by anything and never served to a browser: it exists so the PEM loader is exercised
against the shape acme.sh actually produces -- ECDSA P-256 with a SEC1 private key. Text ahead of
the BEGIN line is ignored by PEM parsers, which is why this note can live in the file.

